	(footprint "uv254:Adafruit_Feather_on_socket_WithMountingHoles"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "0ef54739-1e36-40a6-a411-e2ef47124d17")
		(at 35.08 45.96)
		(descr "Adafruit Feather on 8.5 mm female socket headers (1x16 and 1x12). Pads and outline from KiCad's Module:Adafruit_Feather (https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-feather/feather-specification). 3D: Adafruit's Feather nRF52840 Express model (Adafruit_CAD_Parts, MIT) on its male headers, plugged into KiCad's PinSocket models; the Feather's underside is 11.04 mm above the board With the Feather's four mounting holes, drilled 2.7 mm (M2.5 clearance) for standoffs: M2.5 x 11 mm standoffs match the 8.5 mm socket plus the 2.5 mm header spacer. Each hole has a 6 mm copper keep-out (tracks, vias, fill) on both sides for the standoff and the screw head.")
		(tags "Adafruit Feather socket header nRF52840 mounting holes standoff M2.5")
